Subject: [PATCH] Preserve the active physical state when adapting centering

---
 src/Reparametrizations.jl              | 15 +++++++--
 test/active_reparametrization_state.jl | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 test/runtests.jl                       |  1 +
 3 files changed, 57 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
